1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,620
You told me the odds were unbeatable

2
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:04,180
And I know what stage four means

3
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:07,300
But you never told me I was unbreakable

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,780
Or what a promise does to me

5
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:12,660
So I took a look at my shadow

6
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:15,700
Saw the dirt still on my boots

7
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:18,100
Quit staring at the clock

8
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:21,000
And I started digging roots
